SCOPE PACE

TITLE

PACE is fully independent and self-governing; consumers depend on PACE, not
the reverse. A consumer's useful pattern improves PACE only upstream, with
the project owner's prior authorization.

RAW_TEXT

PACE has its own repository and depends on nothing from TuPerimetro. The
latter is only a consumer of PACE, and only helps PACE improve when, in
using it, it creates a structure useful to the project that PACE can then
use to improve itself — with the prior authorization of the project's owner
to improve PACE.

